Depends: libiosexec1 (>= 1.3.1), xios-sdl2, libsdl2-image-2.0-0, libsdl2-mixer-2.0-0, libboost-game1.90, libicu78, libcurl4, libssl3, libvorbisfile3, libfontconfig1, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0
Description: Battle for Wesnoth turn-based strategy game for Xios
